{"boek":"nahum","inhoudelijke_controle_voltooid":false,"verzen":47,"koppelingen":545,"verzen_zonder_grondtekst":0,"verzen_zonder_koppelingslaag":0,"fouten":[],"woorden_zonder_link":[{"ref":"nahum/1/1","tekst":" De last van Nineve. Het boek van het visioen van Nahum, de Elkosiet.","woorden":[{"woord":"De","start":1,"eind":3},{"woord":"van","start":9,"eind":12},{"woord":"Het","start":21,"eind":24},{"woord":"van","start":30,"eind":33},{"woord":"het","start":34,"eind":37},{"woord":"van","start":46,"eind":49},{"woord":"de","start":57,"eind":59}]},{"ref":"nahum/1/2","tekst":"Een jaloers God en een wreker is JAHWEH, een wreker is JAHWEH, en zeer grimmig; een wreker is JAHWEH aan Zijn tegenstanders, en Hij behoudt de toorn Zijn vijanden.","woorden":[{"woord":"Een","start":0,"eind":3},{"woord":"en","start":16,"eind":18},{"woord":"een","start":19,"eind":22},{"woord":"is","start":30,"eind":32},{"woord":"een","start":41,"eind":44},{"woord":"is","start":52,"eind":54},{"woord":"en","start":63,"eind":65},{"woord":"een","start":80,"eind":83},{"woord":"is","start":91,"eind":93},{"woord":"aan","start":101,"eind":104},{"woord":"Zijn","start":105,"eind":109},{"woord":"en","start":125,"eind":127},{"woord":"de","start":140,"eind":142},{"woord":"toorn","start":143,"eind":148},{"woord":"Zijn","start":149,"eind":153}]},{"ref":"nahum/1/3","tekst":"JAHWEH is geduldig, maar van grote kracht, en Hij houdt de schuldige in geen geval onschuldig. De weg van JAHWEH is in wervelwind, en in storm, en de wolken zijn het stof van Zijn voeten.","woorden":[{"woord":"is","start":7,"eind":9},{"woord":"maar","start":20,"eind":24},{"woord":"van","start":25,"eind":28},{"woord":"en","start":43,"eind":45},{"woord":"Hij","start":46,"eind":49},{"woord":"de","start":56,"eind":58},{"woord":"schuldige","start":59,"eind":68},{"woord":"in","start":69,"eind":71},{"woord":"geval","start":77,"eind":82},{"woord":"De","start":95,"eind":97},{"woord":"van","start":102,"eind":105},{"woord":"is","start":113,"eind":115},{"woord":"in","start":116,"eind":118},{"woord":"en","start":131,"eind":133},{"woord":"in","start":134,"eind":136},{"woord":"en","start":144,"eind":146},{"woord":"de","start":147,"eind":149},{"woord":"zijn","start":157,"eind":161},{"woord":"het","start":162,"eind":165},{"woord":"van","start":171,"eind":174},{"woord":"Zijn","start":175,"eind":179}]},{"ref":"nahum/1/4","tekst":"Hij bestraft de zee, en maakt ze droog, en Hij verdroogt alle rivieren; Basan en Karmel verwelken, ook verwelkt de bloem van Libanon.","woorden":[{"woord":"Hij","start":0,"eind":3},{"woord":"de","start":13,"eind":15},{"woord":"en","start":21,"eind":23},{"woord":"maakt","start":24,"eind":29},{"woord":"ze","start":30,"eind":32},{"woord":"en","start":40,"eind":42},{"woord":"Hij","start":43,"eind":46},{"woord":"en","start":78,"eind":80},{"woord":"ook","start":99,"eind":102},{"woord":"de","start":112,"eind":114},{"woord":"van","start":121,"eind":124}]},{"ref":"nahum/1/5","tekst":" De bergen beven voor Hem, en de heuvelen versmelten; en de aarde licht zich op voor Zijn aangezicht, en de wereld, en allen, die daarin wonen.","woorden":[{"woord":"De","start":1,"eind":3},{"woord":"en","start":27,"eind":29},{"woord":"de","start":30,"eind":32},{"woord":"en","start":54,"eind":56},{"woord":"de","start":57,"eind":59},{"woord":"zich","start":72,"eind":76},{"woord":"op","start":77,"eind":79},{"woord":"voor","start":80,"eind":84},{"woord":"Zijn","start":85,"eind":89},{"woord":"en","start":102,"eind":104},{"woord":"de","start":105,"eind":107},{"woord":"en","start":116,"eind":118},{"woord":"die","start":126,"eind":129},{"woord":"daarin","start":130,"eind":136}]},{"ref":"nahum/1/6","tekst":"Wie zal voor Zijn toorn staan, en wie zal voor de hitte van Zijn toorn bestaan? Zijn woede is uitgestort als vuur, en de rotsstenen worden van Hem vermorzeld.","woorden":[{"woord":"zal","start":4,"eind":7},{"woord":"Zijn","start":13,"eind":17},{"woord":"en","start":31,"eind":33},{"woord":"zal","start":38,"eind":41},{"woord":"voor","star