plegen dronken te zijn, zo worden zij volkomen verteerd, als een dorre stoppel.","woorden":[{"woord":"zij","start":6,"eind":9},{"woord":"in","start":10,"eind":12},{"woord":"elkaar","start":13,"eind":19},{"woord":"zijn","start":31,"eind":35},{"woord":"en","start":49,"eind":51},{"woord":"zijn","start":60,"eind":64},{"woord":"zoals","start":66,"eind":71},{"woord":"zij","start":72,"eind":75},{"woord":"plegen","start":76,"eind":82},{"woord":"te","start":91,"eind":93},{"woord":"zijn","start":94,"eind":98},{"woord":"zo","start":100,"eind":102},{"woord":"worden","start":103,"eind":109},{"woord":"zij","start":110,"eind":113},{"woord":"als","start":133,"eind":136},{"woord":"een","start":137,"eind":140}]},{"ref":"nahum/1/11","tekst":"Van u is één uitgegaan, die kwaad denkt tegen JAHWEH, een Belialsraadsman.","woorden":[{"woord":"is","start":6,"eind":8},{"woord":"één","start":9,"eind":12},{"woord":"die","start":24,"eind":27},{"woord":"een","start":54,"eind":57}]},{"ref":"nahum/1/12","tekst":"Zo zegt JAHWEH: Zijn zij voorspoedig, en zo velen, zo zullen zij ook geschoren worden, en hij zal doorgaan; Ik heb u wel vernederd, maar Ik zal u niet meer drukken.","woorden":[{"woord":"Zijn","start":16,"eind":20},{"woord":"zij","start":21,"eind":24},{"woord":"en","start":38,"eind":40},{"woord":"zullen","start":54,"eind":60},{"woord":"zij","start":61,"eind":64},{"woord":"ook","start":65,"eind":68},{"woord":"worden","start":79,"eind":85},{"woord":"en","start":87,"eind":89},{"woord":"hij","start":90,"eind":93},{"woord":"zal","start":94,"eind":97},{"woord":"Ik","start":108,"eind":110},{"woord":"heb","start":111,"eind":114},{"woord":"u","start":115,"eind":116},{"woord":"wel","start":117,"eind":120},{"woord":"maar","start":132,"eind":136},{"woord":"Ik","start":137,"eind":139},{"woord":"zal","start":140,"eind":143},{"woord":"u","start":144,"eind":145}]},{"ref":"nahum/1/13","tekst":"Maar nu zal Ik zijn juk van u breken, en zal uw banden verscheuren.","woorden":[{"woord":"Maar","start":0,"eind":4},{"woord":"zal","start":8,"eind":11},{"woord":"Ik","start":12,"eind":14},{"woord":"zijn","start":15,"eind":19},{"woord":"en","start":38,"eind":40},{"woord":"zal","start":41,"eind":44},{"woord":"uw","start":45,"eind":47}]},{"ref":"nahum/1/14","tekst":"Maar tegen u heeft JAHWEH bevolen, dat er van uw naam niemand meer gezaaid zal worden; uit het huis van uw god zal Ik uitroeien de gesneden en gegoten beelden; Ik zal u daar een graf maken, als u zult veracht zijn geworden.","woorden":[{"woord":"Maar","start":0,"eind":4},{"woord":"heeft","start":13,"eind":18},{"woord":"dat","start":35,"eind":38},{"woord":"er","start":39,"eind":41},{"woord":"van","start":42,"eind":45},{"woord":"uw","start":46,"eind":48},{"woord":"zal","start":75,"eind":78},{"woord":"worden","start":79,"eind":85},{"woord":"uit","start":87,"eind":90},{"woord":"het","start":91,"eind":94},{"woord":"van","start":100,"eind":103},{"woord":"uw","start":104,"eind":106},{"woord":"zal","start":111,"eind":114},{"woord":"Ik","start":115,"eind":117},{"woord":"de","start":128,"eind":130},{"woord":"en","start":140,"eind":142},{"woord":"beelden","start":151,"eind":158},{"woord":"Ik","start":160,"eind":162},{"woord":"zal","start":163,"eind":166},{"woord":"u","start":167,"eind":168},{"woord":"daar","start":169,"eind":173},{"woord":"een","start":174,"eind":177},{"woord":"u","start":194,"eind":195},{"woord":"zult","start":196,"eind":200},{"woord":"zijn","start":209,"eind":213},{"woord":"geworden","start":214,"eind":222}]},{"ref":"nahum/1/15","tekst":" Zie op de bergen de voeten van degene, die het goede boodschapt, die vrede doet horen; vier uw vierdagen, o Juda! betaal uw geloften; want de Belialsman zal voortaan niet meer door u doorgaan, hij is geheel uitgeroeid.","woorden":[{"woord":"de","start":8,"eind":10},{"woord":"de","start":18,"eind":20},{"woord":"van","start":28,"eind":31},{"woord":"degene","start":32,"eind":38},{"woord":"die","start":40,"eind":43},{"woord":"het","start":44,"eind":47},{"woord":"goede","start":48,"eind":53},{"woord":"die","start":66,"eind":69},{"woord":"doet","start":76,"eind":80},{"woord":"uw","start":93,"eind":95},{"woord":"o","start":107,"eind":108},{"woord":"uw","start":122,"eind":124},{"woord":"de","start":140,"eind":142},{"woord":"zal","start":154,"eind":157},{"woord":"door","start":177,"eind":181},{"woord":"u","start":182,"eind":183},{"woord":"hij","start":194,"eind":197},{"woord":"is","start":198,"eind":200}]},{"ref":"nahum/2/1","tekst":" De verstrooier trekt tegen uw aangezicht op, bewaar de vesting; bezichtig de weg; sterk de middel, versterk de kracht zeer.","woorden":[{"woord":"De","start":1,"eind":3},{"woord":"uw","start":28,"eind":30},{"woord":"op","start":42,"eind":44},{"woord":"de","start":53,"eind":55},{"woord":"de","start":75,"eind":77},{"woord":"de","start":89,"eind":91},{"woord":"de","start":109,"eind":111}]},{"ref":"nahum/2/2","tekst":"Want JAHWEH heeft de hoogmoed van Jakob afgewend, zoals de hoogmoed van Israël; want de plunderaars hebben ze leeg gemaakt, en zij hebben hun wijnranken verdorven.","woorden":[{"woord":"heeft","start":12,"eind":17},{"woord":"de","start":18,"eind":20},{"woord":"van","start":30,"eind":33},{"woord":"zoals","start":50,"eind":55},{"woord":"de","start":56,"eind":58},{"woord":"van","start":68,"eind":71},{"woord":"de","start":85,"eind":87},{"woord":"hebben","start":100,"eind":106},{"woord":"ze","start":107,"eind":109},{"woord":"en","start":124,"eind":126},{"woord":"zij","start":127,"eind":130},{"woord":"hebben","start":131,"eind":137},{"woord":"hun","start":138,"eind":141}]},{"ref":"nahum/2/3","tekst":" De schilden van zijn helden zijn rood gemaakt, de kloeke mannen zijn scharlakenvervig; de wagens zijn in het vuur van de fakkelen, op de dag als hij zich bereidt; en de speren worden geschud.","woorden":[{"woord":"De","start":1,"eind":3},{"woord":"van","start":13,"eind":16},{"woord":"zijn","start":17,"eind":21},{"woord":"zijn","start":29,"eind":33},{"woord":"gemaakt","start":39,"eind":46},{"woord":"de","start":48,"eind":50},{"woord":"zijn","start":65,"eind":69},{"woord":"de","start":88,"eind":90},{"woord":"zijn","start":98,"eind":102},{"woord":"in","start":103,"eind":105},{"woord":"het","start":106,"eind":109},{"woord":"van","start":115,"eind":118},{"woord":"de","start":119,"eind":121},{"woord":"op","start":132,"eind":134},{"woord":"de","start":135,"eind":137},{"woord":"als","start":142,"eind":145},{"woord":"hij","start":146,"eind":149},{"woord":"zich","start":150,"eind":154},{"woord":"en","start":164,"eind":166},{"woord":"de","start":167,"eind":169},{"woord":"worden","start":177,"eind":183}]},{"ref":"nahum/2/4","tekst":" De wagens razen door de wijken, zij lopen ginds en weer op de straten; hun gedaanten zijn als van de fakkelen, zij lopen door elkaar heen als de bliksemen.","woorden":[{"woord":"De","start":1,"eind":3},{"woord":"door","start":17,"eind":21},{"woord":"de","start":22,"eind":24},{"woord":"zij","start":33,"eind":36},{"woord":"ginds","start":43,"eind":48},{"woord":"en","start":49,"eind":51},{"woord":"weer","start":52,"eind":56},{"woord":"op","start":57,"eind":59},{"woord":"de","start":60,"eind":62},{"woord":"hun","start":72,"eind":75},{"woord":"zijn","start":86,"eind":90},{"woord":"als","start":91,"eind":94},{"woord":"van","start":95,"eind":98},{"woord":"de","start":99,"eind":101},{"woord":"zij","start":112,"eind":115},{"woord":"door","start":122,"eind":126},{"woord":"elkaar","start":127,"eind":133},{"woord":"heen","start":134,"eind":138},{"woord":"als","start":139,"eind":142},{"woord":"de","start":143,"eind":145}]},{"ref":"nahum/2/5","tekst":" Hij zal aan zijn voortreffelijken gedenken, maar zij zullen struikelen in hun tochten; zij zullen haasten naar hun muur, als het beschutsel gereed zal wezen.","woorden":[{"woord":"Hij","start":1,"eind":4},{"woord":"zal","start":5,"eind":8},{"woord":"aan","start":9,"eind":12},{"woord":"zijn","start":13,"eind":17},{"woord":"maar","start":45,"eind":49},{"woord":"zij","start":50,"eind":53},{"woord":"zullen","start":54,"eind":60},{"woord":"in","start":72,"eind":74},{"woord":"hun","start":75,"eind":78},{"woord":"zij","start":88,"eind":91},{"woord":"zullen","start":92,"eind":98},{"woord":"naar","start":107,"eind":111},{"woord":"hun","start":112,"eind":115},{"woord":"als","start":122,"eind":125},{"woord":"het","start":126,"eind":129},{"woord":"zal","start":148,"eind":151},{"woord":"wezen","start":152,"eind":157}]},{"ref":"nahum/2/6","tekst":" De poorten van de rivieren zullen geopend worden, en het paleis zal versmelten.","woorden":[{"woord":"De","start":1,"eind":3},{"woord":"van","start":12,"eind":15},{"woord":"de","start":16,"eind":18},{"woord":"zullen","start":28,"eind":34},{"woord":"worden","start":43,"eind":49},{"woord":"en","start":51,"eind":53},{"woord":"het","start":54,"eind":57},{"woord":"zal","start":65,"eind":68}]},{"ref":"nahum/2/7","tekst":"En Huzab zal als gevangene weggevoerd worden, men zal haar heten voortgaan; en haar maagden zullen haar geleiden, als met een stem van de duiven, trommelende op haar harten.","woorden":[{"woord":"En","start":0,"eind":2},{"woord":"zal","start":9,"eind":12},{"woord":"als","start":13,"eind":16},{"woord":"gevangene","start":17,"eind":26},{"woord":"worden","start":38,"eind":44},{"woord":"men","start":46,"eind":49},{"woord":"zal","start":50,"eind":53},{"woord":"haar","start":54,"eind":58},{"woord":"heten","start":59,"eind":64},{"woord":"en","start":76,"eind":78},{"woord":"haar","start":79,"eind":83},{"woord":"zullen","start":92,"eind":98},{"woord":"haar","start":99,"eind":103},{"woord":"als","start":114,"eind":117},{"woord":"met","start":118,"eind":121},{"woord":"een","start":122,"eind":125},{"woord":"van","start":131,"eind":134},{"woord":"de","start":135,"eind":137},{"woord":"haar","start":161,"eind":165}]},{"ref":"nahum/2/8","tekst":" Nineve is wel als een watervijver, van de dagen af dat zij geweest is, maar zij zullen vluchten. Sta, sta! zal men roepen, maar niemand zal omzien.","woorden":[{"woord":"is","start":8,"eind":10},{"woord":"wel","start"